#. 葉隠クンはボクと話してる最中、
#. <CLT 3>小さな紙<CLT>を落としてたよね？
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hiro...when we were talking before, you dropped a\n"
"<CLT 3>small piece of paper<CLT>, remember?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>赤い水玉模様の紙<CLT>だよ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It was <CLT 3>white with red polka dots<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで、急にそんな事を言うんだべ！？
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wh-What's that got to do with anything!?"
msgstr ""

#. 赤い水玉模様って…
msgctxt "0004 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Red polka dots...?"
msgstr ""

#. 私がさくらちゃんにあげた<CLT 3>アメの包装紙<CLT>と一緒だ！
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"That's gotta be the <CLT 3>wrapper from the candy<CLT> I gave\n"
"Sakura!"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…それは…その…
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N-No, it's...it's, um..."
msgstr ""

#. あのアメは、倉庫に入れるようになった直後、
#. 私がダンボールごと独り占めしてるから…
msgctxt "0007 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Ever since we got into the warehouse, I totally\n"
"monopolized that entire box of candy."
msgstr ""

#. それと同じ物は、もう倉庫にも残ってないはずだよ！
msgctxt "0008 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So there's no way a single one of them was left in the\n"
"warehouse!"
msgstr ""

#. だとしたら、葉隠クンは、
#. そのアメをどこで手に入れたの？
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In that case, Hiro...where *did* you get that piece of\n"
"candy?"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんからだ！　それしかないよ！
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "From Sakura! It's the only explanation!"
msgstr ""

#. え、えーと……
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "U-Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. そ、その…
#. オーガから貰ったのは…確かだけど…
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "W-Well, I mean...yeah, sure I got it from her, but..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、貰ったのはずいぶん前なんだ！
#. だから事件とは関係ないんだって！！
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But she gave it to me forever ago! It doesn't have\n"
"anything to do with what happened to her!"
msgstr ""

#. いつ…貰ったの…？
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "When? When did she give it to you?"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クンが大神さんと最後に会ったのって…
#. 朝日奈さんを、保健室に連れて行った時だよね？
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The last time you saw Sakura was...when Hina had to go\n"
"to the nurse's office, right?"
msgstr ""

#. つ、つまり…
#. あの時より前に貰ったって事だべ…
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Y-Yeah, so I musta got it...some time before then."
msgstr ""

#. 大神がアメを貰った時間帯
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "When Sakura got that candy"
msgstr ""

#. 大神はアメが大好物
msgctxt "0018 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Sakura loved candy too much to share"
msgstr ""

#. 大神さんはアメが大好物だったんだ！
#. そんな大神さんが葉隠クンにアメをあげるはずがない！
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Sakura loved candy more than life itself! No way would\n"
"she have given a piece to Hiro!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、葉隠クンは大神さんが死んだ後に、
#. 大神さんが持っていたアメを奪ったんだ！
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So Hiro must have stolen it off of her corpse after\n"
"she was dead!"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、保健室での一件以降って事だよ！
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"In other words, *after* the incident in the nurse's\n"
"office!"
msgstr ""

#. さくらちゃんの好物がアメだなんて
#. 聞いた事ないよ！
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Sakura never told me she liked candy that much!"
msgstr ""

#. うん…そうだよね…
#. ボクも聞いた事ないよ…
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Yeah, actually...she never told me that, either..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 葉隠は朝日奈からも貰っていた
msgctxt "0025 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Hiro got the candy from Hina"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そーだべ…！！
#. 朝日奈っちからも、アメを貰ったんだ！
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Y-Yeah! I got my piece from Hina, too! That's the\n"
"ticket!"
msgstr ""

#. あれはその時のアメの包装紙だべ！
#. ほら、あの時あの時！
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"And that's where the wrapper came from! From when Hina\n"
"gave me a piece that one time!"
msgstr ""

#. え…？　どの時…？
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh? What...one time?"
msgstr ""

#. …って、そんな訳ないじゃんッ！
#. なんでアンタみたいなバカにあげなきゃなんないのッ！
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"As if! Why would I ever give a moron like you any of\n"
"my candy!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぐッ！　ヒデー言われようだべ…！
msgctxt "0030 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ugah! Y-You don't have to say it like that...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンは大神さんからアメをもらい…
#. そのアメは大神さんが朝日奈さんにもらった物で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hiro got the candy from Sakura, and Sakura got the\n"
"candy from Hina...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>という事は、朝日奈さんが大神さんにあげた後に、
#. 葉隠クンは大神さんからもらった訳で…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So Hina gave it to Sakura, then Sakura gave it to\n"
"Hiro, so...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. な、何を考え込んでんだべ…？
#. あんまり深く考えるのは止めてほしいべ…
msgctxt "0034 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Wh-What are you getting at? I don't think you gotta\n"
"think about it so hard...I think."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 大神さんが葉隠クンにあげたアメは、
#. 大神さんが朝日奈さんから貰ったものだから…
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The candy that Hiro got from Sakura was the piece\n"
"she'd gotten from Hina..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…そんなはずない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...what Hiro said can't be right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大神さんからアメを貰ったのは、
#. あの保健室の一件よりも後だったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Because Sakura could only have gotten the candy\n"
"*after* the incident in the nurse's office.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その根拠になるのは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the reason I know that is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠クン…それはおかしいよ…
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm not sure about that, Hiro..."
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈さんが、大神さんにアメをあげたのは、
#. <CLT 3>保健室から出た後<CLT>だったんだ。
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Hina didn't actually give Sakura the candy till <CLT 3>after\n"
"she left the nurse's office<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 保健室で会ったのが最後なら、
#. 葉隠クンがそのアメを貰ってるはずがないんだよ！
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So if that was the last time you saw her, there's no\n"
"reason you should've had that candy!"
msgstr ""

#. あれまッ！？
msgctxt "0043 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Dammit!"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それは…えーと…その……
msgctxt "0044 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Er, I mean...what I meant was, uh..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0045 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. あぁ、会ったさ！　娯楽室でオーガと会ったさ！
#. それの何が悪いんだって！！
msgctxt "0046 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's right! I DID meet up with her in the rec\n"
"room! You got a problem with that!?"
msgstr ""

#. え、逆ギレ？
msgctxt "0047 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Why the s-sudden hostility...?"
msgstr ""

#. だけど、会っただけだべ！
#. 俺はなんもしてねーって！　お願い信じて！！
msgctxt "0048 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But we just talked, that's all! I didn't do anything!\n"
"You gotta believe me!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、怪しいわね…あなた…
msgctxt "0049 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Y-You're acting incredibly s-suspicious..."
msgstr ""

#. 怪しいのはオメーの方だべ！！
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "YOU'RE acting incredibly suspicious!"
msgstr ""

#. …また逆ギレ？
msgctxt "0051 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "More h-hostility..."
msgstr ""

#. ただの逆ギレじゃねーぞ！　犯人は腐川っちなんだ！
#. その証拠だって、あるんだからな！
msgctxt "0052 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It's not just normal hostility! You're the real\n"
"culprit! I even have proof!"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ…？　証拠って…なんの事…？
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? P-Proof? What are you t-talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>シャイニングメッセージ<CLT>だべ！！
msgctxt "0054 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "I'm talking about her <CLT 3>shining message<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>輝いて…どうするんだって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What would a shining message even be...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 現場に<CLT 3>“フカワ”<CLT>って<CLT 3>血文字<CLT>があったろ？
msgctxt "0056 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"At the scene of the crime, she had written out\n"
"\"<CLT 3>Toko<CLT>\" in <CLT 3>her own blood<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ！　<CLT 3>ダイイングメッセージ<CLT>だべ！
#. 舞園っちの時にも…そんな事を言ってたじゃねーか！
msgctxt "0057 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It was her \"<CLT 3>dying message<CLT>\"! Just like what you guys\n"
"were talking about with Sayaka!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、それって私も見た！
msgctxt "0058 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That's true, I saw it for myself!"
msgstr ""

#. そーだろ、そーだろ！
#. 犯人は腐川っちなんだべ！！
msgctxt "0059 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "See? See!? Toko did it!"
msgstr ""

#. な、な、何言ってんのよ！
#. そんな訳…ないじゃない…！
msgctxt "0060 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Wh-Wh-What are you saying!? No w-way! I didn't d-do\n"
"it!"
msgstr ""

#. 往生際がわりーぞ！
msgctxt "0061 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "You just don't know when you're beat, do ya!?"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠君、ちょっと待って…
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Hiro, hold on..."
msgstr ""

#. あなたが、そのダイイングメッセージを見つけたのは、
#. いつの事？
msgctxt "0063 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "When did you see that dying message of hers?"
msgstr ""

#. へ…？
msgctxt "0064 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. えーっと…確か…
#. オーガの死体を発見した時だべ…
msgctxt "0065 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "W-Well, when we found Ogre's body. Duh..."
msgstr ""

#. そうだったわね。あなたは朝日奈さんから
#. 現場の捜査を禁止されていたのよね…
msgctxt "0066 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But if you recall, Hina was very adamant about keeping\n"
"you away from the scene of the crime."
msgstr ""

#. つまり、ダイイングメッセージを見つけたなら、
#. 死体を発見した時しかないはずよね。
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So it's hard to believe that's when you actually saw\n"
"the message for yourself."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれ、待てよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Huh? Hold on...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 雑誌棚の中
msgctxt "0069 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "On the magazine shelf"
msgstr ""

#. 雑誌棚の上
msgctxt "0070 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Above the magazine shelf"
msgstr ""

#. あの雑誌は雑誌棚の上にあったはずだよ。
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The magazine was way up above the magazine shelf."
msgstr ""

#. あんなに高いところにあったのに、
#. どうして見つけられたの…？
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"How were you able to spot it, despite it being so high\n"
"up?"
msgstr ""

#. お、俺は目が長いからそれくらい見えるんだ！
#. おかしくなんかないべ！
msgctxt "0073 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"B-Because my eyes are, like...super long! What's so\n"
"strange about that!?"
msgstr ""

#. 目が長い…って、何…？
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Your eyes are...long? What does that mean?"
msgstr ""

#. っていうか、
#. 雑誌棚の上じゃなかった気がしてきた…
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Actually, now that I think about it...I'm pretty sure\n"
"the magazine wasn't above the shelf, anyway..."
msgstr ""

#. なんか…ごめん…
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sorry about that."
msgstr ""

#. へ？
msgctxt "0077 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. そりゃねーべ…
#. 俺の一世一代の言い訳を返して欲しいべ…
msgctxt "0078 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So that wasn't even right? Give me back my\n"
"once-in-a-lifetime excuse...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 雑誌棚の下
msgctxt "0080 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Under the magazine shelf"
msgstr ""

#. 雑誌棚の下…？
#. 本当に…そんなところだったかしら…？
msgctxt "0081 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Under the shelf...? Are you completely sure about\n"
"that?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>えーっと、ダイイングメッセージは雑誌に書かれてて…
#. その雑誌がどこにあったかと言うと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So the dying message was inside the magazine, and the\n"
"magazine itself was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 葉隠君は現場の捜査を禁止されていたのに…
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Hiro was barred from entering the crime scene, right?"
msgstr ""

#. いつダイイングメッセージを見たのかしらね？
msgctxt "0085 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So when could he have seen the dying message?"
msgstr ""

#. 彼がダイイングメッセージを発見するなら、
#. 死体発見の時しかない…
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If he was going to find it, the only time he could\n"
"have was when the body was first discovered."
msgstr ""

#. でも、死体発見の時には
#. 見えないような場所にあったはず…
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But when we found the body, the magazine was in a\n"
"place where there's no way he could have seen it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Có vẻ như mình vừa mới làm trò hề trước mặt mọi\n"
"người rồi...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>でも、ダイイングメッセージが書かれた雑誌を
#. 霧切さんが見つけた時、あの雑誌があった場所って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But when Kyoko found the magazine with the dying\n"
"message in it, it was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あの雑誌って、霧切さんが見つけた時は、
#. <CLT 3>雑誌棚の中<CLT>にあったんだよね？
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Kyoko, you found the magazine on the <CLT 3>magazine shelf<CLT>,\n"
"right?"
msgstr ""

#. そうよ。私があの雑誌を雑誌棚から取り出して、
#. そこでダイイングメッセージを見つけたのよ。
msgctxt "0091 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"That's right. Looking through the shelf, I found the\n"
"magazine with the dying message on it."
msgstr ""

#. 現場での<CLT 3>捜査が始まった後<CLT>でね…
msgctxt "0092 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I found it right there at the scene of the crime,\n"
"<CLT 3>after we'd started the investigation<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. だとすると、さっきの葉隠クンの発言って、
#. おかしいよね？
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If that's true, then what Hiro just said doesn't\n"
"really make sense, does it?"
msgstr ""

#. …お、おかしい？
msgctxt "0094 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "D-Doesn't make sense...?"
msgstr ""

#. 何がおかしいんだべ！
#. なんも、おかしくねーっての！！
msgctxt "0095 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"What doesn't make sense!? Everything I said makes\n"
"perfect sense!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、さっきの葉隠クンの発言には、
#. 明らかな矛盾があったはずだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, there's an obvious problem with what Hiro said\n"
"before...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、明らかにおかしい…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's definitely something strange about it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんは、捜査時にダイイングメッセージを
#. 見つけたんだ。だとすると…
